  "result": "Perfect! All 437 tests pass. Here's a summary of the enhancements made:\n\n## Enhanced renderInvoiceText Implementation\n\n**Updated `src/render.js` to add:**\n\n1. **Line-level discount display** - Shows discount for each line that has one\n   - Format: `  Discount (X%): \u20acamount`\n   - Only displayed when discount > 0\n\n2. **Voucher amount** - Displayed just before the total\n   - Format: `Voucher: \u20acamount`\n   - Only shown if voucher exists\n\n3. **Due date** - Displayed after the total\n   - Format: `Due: YYYY-MM-DD`\n   - Only shown if invoice has a due date\n\n4. **Amount paid** - Displayed at the end\n   - Format: `Paid: \u20acamount`\n   - Aggregates all payments if multiple exist\n   - Only shown if invoice has payments\n\n**Example output format:**\n```\nDRAFT\nCustomer Name\n  5x Item @ \u20ac100.00 = \u20ac500.00\n  Discount (10%): \u20ac50.00\n  3x Item @ \u20ac50.00 = \u20ac150.00\nVAT: \u20ac136.50\nVoucher: \u20ac30.00\nTotal: \u20ac756.50\nDue: 2026-11-06\nPaid: \u20ac200.00\n```\n\n**Tests added:** 20 comprehensive tests covering:\n- Individual line discounts\n- Multiple lines with different discounts\n- Voucher display before total\n- Due date display\n- Payment aggregation\n- Output ordering\n- Combination of all features\n- Edge cases and boundary conditions\n\n**Results:** \u2705 All 437 tests pass (417 existing + 20 new)",
